{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231840","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231840","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423184001:1":{"text":"전에는 그랬지. 마을에 일이 터지고 난 다음에는 안 왔으면 했고...","source_cn":"之前想，后来村子出了事不想了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2B89924E668D431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423184002:0":{"text":"이젠 마을도 다시 정상으로 돌아왔잖아. 특사가 와서 둘러보는 것도 나쁘지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"现在不是村子又好起来了嘛，特使来视察视察也没啥吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619828D19CC27DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423184003:1":{"text":"특사가 오면 우리도 환영 연회에 낄 수 있고! 지난번 연회에서 먹었던 칠면조 다리가 너무 먹고 싶어!","source_cn":"要是特使来了，我们还能沾沾光去吃接风宴，我可想念上次宴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EC561506A04F4AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矿工凡特":{"text":"광부 반트","source":"矿工凡特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}